Description: GNU Radio SDR implementation of a LoRa transceiver
 gr-lora_sdr is a fully-functional GNU Radio software-defined radio
 implementation of a LoRa transceiver. It includes all the receiver
 components needed to operate correctly even at very low SNRs, and a
 matching transmitter, packaged as an out-of-tree (OOT) module for
 GNU Radio 3.10.
 .
 The work was conducted at the Telecommunication Circuits Laboratory,
 EPFL.
